<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ATALANTA STRIKER PISANI DIES IN CAR CRASH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ATALANTA STRIKER PISANI DIES IN CAR CRASH.</headline>
<dateline>BERGAMO, Italy 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atalanta striker Federico Pisani was killed with his girlfriend in a car crash early on Wednesday, the Italian serie A club said.</p>
<p>Pisani, 22, had spent his serie A career at Atalanta and made his debut in 1992 with the Bergamo club.</p>
